  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus &#xe0; la fin du programme : 1) La gestion de 179 boursiers en fin de parcours acad&#xe9;mique, dont 92 femmes; 2) la graduation de 135 boursiers, dont 71 femmes; 3) la r&#xe9;insertion de 88 % de boursiers et boursi&#xe8;res dans leurs institutions six mois apr&#xe8;s leur retour au pays; 4) 96 % des boursiers et boursi&#xe8;res affirment avoir obtenu une augmentation de leur connaissances et comp&#xe9;tences &#xe0; la suite de leur formation au Canada.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved at the end of the program include: (1) the management of 179 scholars during the final phase of their education, including 92 women; (2) the graduation of 135 scholars, including 71 women; (3) 88% of scholars re-integrated within their institutions after six months of their return to their country; (4) 96% of scholars affirm having obtained increased knowledge and skills following their training in Canada.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) r&#xe9;insertion effective des boursiers et boursi&#xe8;res qui sont en mesure d&#x2019;effectuer le transfert de leurs connaissances et comp&#xe9;tences dans les institutions partenaires; 2) influence et positionnement accrus des femmes et des hommes, plus particuli&#xe8;rement des femmes, dans les institutions des pays b&#xe9;n&#xe9;ficiaires du PCBF.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results of this project include: (1) effective re-integration of scholars (women and men) that are able to transfer their knowledge and skills in partner institutions; and (2) increased influence and positioning of women and men, particularly women, within the institutions of CFSP beneficiary countries.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
